<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1440570723"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1849523934"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Normal No More"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="TYSM"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Normal No More"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:08.411"><div begin="00:09.155" end="03:08.411"><p begin="00:09.155" end="00:11.621" itunes:key="L3339">I don't wanna be normal no more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我再也不想循规蹈矩</span></p><p begin="00:11.631" end="00:14.141" itunes:key="L3340">I don't wanna take drugs at the club<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不想在夜店触碰**</span></p><p begin="00:14.151" end="00:16.790" itunes:key="L3341">I don't wanna pretend I'm in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不愿假装自己深陷爱河</span></p><p begin="00:16.800" end="00:19.365" itunes:key="L3342">Don't wanna put out just for fun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会为了寻欢作乐而随意付出</span></p><p begin="00:19.375" end="00:21.697" itunes:key="L3343">I don't wanna be normal no more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我再也不想循规蹈矩</span></p><p begin="00:21.744" end="00:24.282" itunes:key="L3344">I don't wanna take drugs at the club<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不想在夜店触碰**</span></p><p begin="00:24.302" end="00:26.922" itunes:key="L3345">I don't wanna pretend I'm in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不愿假装自己深陷爱河</span></p><p begin="00:26.932" end="00:30.105" itunes:key="L3346">Don't wanna put out just for fun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会为了寻欢作乐而随意付出</span></p><p begin="00:50.439" end="00:52.970" itunes:key="L3348">Sober when I'm faded<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便意识模糊 依旧保持清醒</span></p><p begin="00:52.995" end="00:55.458" itunes:key="L3349">Permanent vacation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛处在一场永恒的休憩中</span></p><p begin="00:55.468" end="00:57.967" itunes:key="L3350">Don't care if I'm jaded<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算身心疲惫 也毫不在意</span></p><p begin="00:58.092" end="01:00.641" itunes:key="L3351">Done with all this faking<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">受够了这所有的虚情假意</span></p><p begin="01:00.651" end="01:03.082" itunes:key="L3352">I don't wanna have to try, no<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想再勉强自己</span></p><p begin="01:03.092" end="01:05.554" itunes:key="L3353">I could walk a perfect line, no<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我本可以循规蹈矩 但我不愿</span></p><p begin="01:05.564" end="01:08.103" itunes:key="L3354">I don't want no alibi, no<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不需要任何借口</span></p><p begin="01:08.141" end="01:10.753" itunes:key="L3355">Don't lose any sleep at night, no<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜里也不会辗转难眠</span></p><p begin="01:09.890" end="01:12.281" itunes:key="L3356">I don't wanna be normal no more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我再也不想循规蹈矩</span></p><p begin="01:12.403" end="01:14.755" itunes:key="L3357">I don't wanna take drugs at the club<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不想在夜店触碰**</span></p><p begin="01:14.907" end="01:17.414" itunes:key="L3358">I don't wanna pretend I'm in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不愿假装自己深陷爱河</span></p><p begin="01:17.458" end="01:19.923" itunes:key="L3359">Don't wanna put out just for fun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会为了寻欢作乐而随意付出</span></p><p begin="01:19.970" end="01:22.259" itunes:key="L3360">I don't wanna be normal no more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我再也不想循规蹈矩</span></p><p begin="01:22.425" end="01:24.854" itunes:key="L3361">I don't wanna take drugs at the club<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不想在夜店触碰**</span></p><p begin="01:25.022" end="01:27.415" itunes:key="L3362">I don't wanna pretend I'm in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不愿假装自己深陷爱河</span></p><p begin="01:27.425" end="01:30.702" itunes:key="L3363">Don't wanna put out just for fun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会为了寻欢作乐而随意付出</span></p><p begin="01:51.212" end="01:56.391" itunes:key="L3365">Drinking from the bottle but it's just Pellegrino<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对着瓶子一饮而尽 里面却只是佩莱格里诺矿泉水</span></p><p begin="01:55.660" end="02:01.277" itunes:key="L3366">Getting fucked up got real boring, so it's 'Grino for placebo<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">烂醉如泥的日子实在乏味 所以用矿泉水当作安慰剂</span></p><p begin="02:01.287" end="02:03.746" itunes:key="L3367">I don't wanna have to try, no<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想再勉强自己</span></p><p begin="02:03.756" end="02:06.239" itunes:key="L3368">I could walk a perfect line, no<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我本可以循规蹈矩 但我不愿</span></p><p begin="02:06.277" end="02:08.671" itunes:key="L3369">I don't want no alibi, no<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不需要任何借口</span></p><p begin="02:08.807" end="02:11.543" itunes:key="L3370">Don't lose any sleep at night, no<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜里也不会辗转难眠</span></p><p begin="02:10.497" end="02:12.913" itunes:key="L3371">I don't wanna be normal no more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我再也不想循规蹈矩</span></p><p begin="02:13.052" end="02:15.438" itunes:key="L3372">I don't wanna take drugs at the club<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不想在夜店触碰**</span></p><p begin="02:15.466" end="02:18.052" itunes:key="L3373">I don't wanna pretend I'm in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不愿假装自己深陷爱河</span></p><p begin="02:18.062" end="02:20.670" itunes:key="L3374">Don't wanna put out just for fun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会为了寻欢作乐而随意付出</span></p><p begin="02:20.680" end="02:23.043" itunes:key="L3375">I don't wanna be normal no more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我再也不想循规蹈矩</span></p><p begin="02:23.196" end="02:25.491" itunes:key="L3376">I don't wanna take drugs at the club<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不想在夜店触碰**</span></p><p begin="02:25.609" end="02:28.223" itunes:key="L3377">I don't wanna pretend I'm in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不愿假装自己深陷爱河</span></p><p begin="02:28.233" end="02:31.374" itunes:key="L3378">Don't wanna put out just for fun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会为了寻欢作乐而随意付出</span></p><p begin="02:40.768" end="02:43.272" itunes:key="L3380">I don't wanna be normal no more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我再也不想循规蹈矩</span></p><p begin="02:45.881" end="02:48.206" itunes:key="L3381">I don't wanna be normal no more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我再也不想循规蹈矩</span></p><p begin="02:50.688" end="02:53.289" itunes:key="L3382">I don't wanna be normal no more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我再也不想循规蹈矩</span></p><p begin="03:05.950" end="03:08.411" itunes:key="L3383">I don't wanna be normal no more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我再也不想循规蹈矩</span></p></div></body></tt>